# Since I Don't Have You (Harmonica)

Positive numbers are blow notes.
Negative numbers are draw notes.
Since this one has a little bit tricky rythm, here's a reference:
=> https://youtu.be/REyAEDVgA-Y?si=k3VgR5-UvxYukBfz YouTube

```
 6  5 -4  4 -4  4  3

 3  6  5 -4  4 -4  4  3

 7 -7 -6 -7 -6 -4 -4  4
          -4  4  3

-4  5 -4  5  6 -5 -4

-6 -5  5  6 -5  5  6 -5  5

-4 -4 -4  7 -7 -6  6 -5  5  4 -4  5
          7 -6 -7  7 -7 -6
          6  5 -5  6 -5  5

-4 -4  5 -4  5  5 -4
```

